what could be the name of the file format?

inspirations:

- markdown = mark / down
- japanese words: nexus[ingakankei=igkk]
- refractory = 耐火物 = taikabutsu = tkb
- index (in a book) = 索引 = sakuin = skin
- skill issue = si
- memo = メモ
- connection = 接続 = setsuzoku = stzk
- setsuzoku memo = connection notes
- se su o u memo = double letters
-   t  z k       = single letters = tzk
- s       u m  o = first+last = sumo
-     u      em  = center letters = uem

- btf = boring text file
- stf = stupid text file
- bnf - boring note file
- snf - stupid node file
- btw - by the way / boring text wall

